2026-07-27T14:37:00.8565165Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T14:37:00.8565720Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:37:00.8566367Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T14:37:00.8567211Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
